1. Add **1 ounce gin**, **1 ounce Lillet Blanc**, **¾ ounce orange liqueur**,
   **¾ ounce lemon juice**, **1 ounce simple syrup**, and **⅛ teaspoon absinthe** to cocktail shaker, then fill with ice. Shake mixture until fully combined and well chilled, about 15 seconds.
1. Double-strain cocktail into chilled cocktail glass. Garnish with **orange twist**.
